he main lecture hall, with dozens of classrooms and theatres.\\n-  St. Neptune Stadium: Temperature controlled building hosting an ice rink, indoor pool and sauna.\\n- Fraternity and Sorority Row: Frat houses and sororities, located west of the library.\\n- Nocturnal Hall: Building where night classes are hosted.\\n- Unicorn Hall: Accessible building designed to accomodate hybrid and non-human species.\\n- Lunar Quad: Central campus plaza where the phase of the decorative moon fountain always matches the current moon cycle.\\n- Basilisk Library: Huge five-story library housing one of the largest collections of magical texts and bestiaries in North America.\\n- Griffin Clocktower: Iconic campus landmark topped by griffin-shaped gargoyles that come to life and fly around the tower hourly.\\n- Wyrm Dormitories: Sleek modern mixed-sex dorm complex with suite-style living. Houses a mix of human and supernatural students.\\n</locations>\\n</SUCC>\\n\",\r\n    \"constant\": false,\r\n    \"selective\": true,\r\n    \"selectiveLogic\": 0,\r\n    \"addMemo\": true,\r\n    \"order\": 100,\r\n    \"position\": 0,\r\n    \"disable\": false,\r\n    \"excludeRecursion\": true,\r\n    \"probability\": 100,\r\n    \"useProbability\": true,\r\n    \"depth\": 4,\r\n    \"group\": \"\",\r\n    \"scanDepth\": null,\r\n    \"caseSensitive\": null,\r\n    \"matchWholeWords\": true,\r\n    \"automationId\": \"\",\r\n    \"role\": null,\r\n    \"displayIndex\": 41,\r\n    \"preventRecursion\": true,\r\n    \"groupOverride\": false,\r\n    \"groupWeight\": 100,\r\n    \"vectorized\": false,\r\n    \"delayUntilRecursion\": false,\r\n    \"useGroupScoring\": null,\r\n    \"sticky\": 0,\r\n    \"cooldown\": 0,\r\n    \"delay\": 0,\r\n    \"matchPersonaDescription\": false,\r\n    \"matchCharacterDescription\": false,\r\n    \"matchCharacterPersonality\": false,\r\n    \"matchCharacterDepthPrompt\": false,\r\n    \"matchScenario\": false,\r\n    \"matchCreatorNotes\": false,\r\n    \"ignoreBudg